# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the fuzz harnesses (LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=<this file>).
# A rule hides every leak with that function anywhere in its allocation stack: one rule per
# library function found leaking, never a public entry point such as cg_open, under which a
# missing cg_close of ours would also hide. Remove a rule once a fixed library is in use.
# CGNS 4.5.2 returns CG_ERROR without freeing the node ids of cgi_get_nodes:
# cg_version, on its error paths (and the node data);
leak:^cg_version$
# cgi_read_zboco, when cgi_read_boco fails on one of the BC_t nodes.
leak:^cgi_read_zboco$
